{"c":[{"id":"c478d1d3f328d8fa","sum":"1.5.4 no vss: HNSW blocks embeddings writes, even no-match; DROP INDEX IF EXISTS in a transaction first. Crash leaves orphans; top-k may be short, never an error. Ties break by harness, then id. SET enable_progress_bar = false. Remove Hub filter after model load (2.0.0 nanobind).","tree":{"c":[{"id":"31075c4daaf75233","sum":"1.5.4, no vss: INSERT/DELETE fails on HNSW (unknown index type), even no-match; DROP INDEX IF EXISTS in a transaction works. Drop before writes (2026-10-22). No orphan guard: per-statement commits can leave orphans until next ingest or embed; top-k may be short, never an error.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261022T131311Z-ed378e2bb230c4e6","text":"DuckDB 1.5.4 without vss on a file with the HNSW index: every INSERT or DELETE on embeddings fails (Cannot bind index, unknown index type HNSW), even a no-match delete; DROP INDEX IF EXISTS in a transaction works. Drop the index before any write. Measured 2026-10-22.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261022T134653Z-aa09ea6b143ae13d","text":"Operator 2026-10-22: exact semantic search has no orphan guard. write_session commits each statement separately, so an ingest crash can leave orphan embeddings until the next ingest or embed; a top-k search may then be short, never an error.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"584c14263b4266e5","sum":"Identical vectors are common (150 at distance 0), so exact search breaks top-k ties by harness, then id. SET enable_progress_bar = false to parse DuckDB query stdout. 2.0.0 embed/semantic leaks nanobind at exit: the Hub filter pins stockroom.embed; remove it after model load.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261022T175949Z-e9f28fbf7dbe5041","text":"2026-10-22: live data has many identical vectors (one query: 150 owners at distance 0), so top-k ties at the cut are common; exact semantic breaks them by harness, then id. DuckDB Python draws a progress bar on stdout for long queries; SET enable_progress_bar = false to parse it.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261022T183706Z-584e9a2f3117f291","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0 nanobind 'leaked instances' at exit of embed/semantic: stockroom's own HF Hub logger filter (_DropUnauthenticatedHubWarning) stays on the logger for the process; its class pins stockroom.embed globals, so duckdb. Removing it after model load: no warning (2026-10-22).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"3c4fa613bace7a79","sum":"Backups: warehouse.issue147-<purpose>.duckdb spares .bak. Pytest+torch nanobind leaks (none if no torch; embed/semantic none). Inverse skips: CLI if installed, doctor.py:205 if loaded; pytest -rs. zstd fails v1.0.0/v1.1.0, ok v1.2.0+; mem Uncompressed; no ALTER. schema-0 12288B.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"7848f6afe9cf5adb","sum":"Stockroom backups are warehouse.issue147-<purpose>.duckdb, so delete-if-present never removes a user's .bak. Pytest that imports torch in-process prints nanobind leaks at exit; code unchanged. No torch: none. embed/semantic: none after the Hub-filter fix.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261022T194525Z-96009f5f2a711415","text":"Operator 2026-10-22: every warehouse backup stockroom or its contributors make is named warehouse.issue147-<purpose>.duckdb in the stockroom home (M2: warehouse.issue147-pre-duckdb2.duckdb), so later delete-if-present code removes only ours, never a user's own .bak.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261022T202007Z-8202b18ddd62b1e1","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0, measured 2026-10-22: a pytest process that loads the engine conftest and imports torch in-process (importorskip) prints nanobind leaked-instance lines at exit; exit code unchanged. No torch: none. embed/semantic subprocesses: none after the Hub-filter fix.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"4ace2c55b4ea657f","sum":"Inverse torch skips: CLI skips when torch is installed, doctor.py:205 when loaded. Skip counts do not prove they ran; use pytest -rs. DuckDB 2 zstd fails on v1.0.0/v1.1.0, works from v1.2.0; memory stores Uncompressed. No ALTER. v2.1.2 schema-0 leftover is a bare 12288-byte file.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261022T230859Z-f3b33970b7939cf9","text":"Engine suite has inverse torch skips: test_doctor_cli.py:54 skips when torch is installed, test_doctor.py:205 when torch is already loaded in the worker. Skip counts do not prove torch-gated tests ran; use pytest -rs.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T001340Z-97dfabc9146bc1fb","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0, measured 2026-10-22: USING COMPRESSION zstd raises BinderException on v1.0.0 and v1.1.0 files, works from v1.2.0; in-memory accepts it (stores Uncompressed). No ALTER sets compression. v2.1.2's schema-0 leftover is a bare 12,288-byte file, no tables.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
